{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（29日）下午2時許，警方接報指黃大仙道及馬仔坑道交界爆水管。</p><p>黃大仙上邨緊急暫停食水供應，水務署派5輛水車到場為居民提供食水。</p><p>據水務署網站，預計明日（30日）凌晨3時恢復供水。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:47.244339+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:25:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.600085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.303122+00:00","content_hash":"d728115221c126b7c8ebb9a49a400e898f3681961e42d9c8744fa1963b65d157","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}